*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0014.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY INT0014C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 EFFECTIVE-RATE     PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM APPLY-BONUS
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "EFFECTIVE-RATE=" EFFECTIVE-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-BONUS.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS
    IF CLNT-AGE >= 55
       AND LEDGER-BAL >= 5000
        COMPUTE EFFECTIVE-RATE = BASE-INT-RATE + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE BASE-INT-RATE TO EFFECTIVE-RATE
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    *> FIXED DEPOSIT UPLIFT
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'F'
        COMPUTE EFFECTIVE-RATE ROUNDED = EFFECTIVE-RATE + 0.0010
    END-IF.
